  "sources": [
    "sms-fw c-cpp/libsrc/kernel/dialib/yppdia_refund_avptemplate.cf and actual AvpsTemplate/AvpImpl/dia-message/dia-cc/DccaClientWrapper sources; spec/batch-42.md and source projection evidence",
    "Fixed Vendor0 Grouped420 ONLY at CCR/456/437, containing445/{447 Integer64,429 Integer32} and425 Integer32. No standard420 alternative or length/Action dispatch. Closed extras, separate Bundle from standard Ro and IEC-only profile. Initial slice was REFUND EVENT4/Number0/Action1 P1; batch44 expands as recorded below; top0/1292 binary token required, empty distinct from missing. Explicit amounts/units, no template financial defaults or qualification/OCS credential lookup.",
    "Batch44: actual general template32nodes adds fixed413 money, signed top439/10425:23, RFC Address2018, MMS raw STRING897; direct0 and balance2. Refund1 retains fixed Grouped420. Top CCA423 cost/431 units/422 balance; no dynamic type dispatch, no business defaults. RFC8506 sections6.2,8.6-8.9.",
    "Batch48: source DIACCParseAnswer/CCRecord consumes top Cost/GSU/CheckBalance/DDFH and optional MSCC ResultCode; keep command/service results separate, no last-wins or financial success inference. One unkeyed result-only MSCC, fixed Vendor0/456/268; no child grant/token/service key. Adds4010/4011/5030 at command and service levels; Cost for IEC/ECUR only selected clean2001, DDFH only originalEVENT/DIRECT_DEBITING. Source token Vendor and PSP873/20400/20430 Vendor remain unproved; do not infer them. RFC4006/8506 sections5.1.2,8.7,8.15-16,9. No automatic policy/recovery.",
    "Batch49: RFC4006 sections4.1.3/9.2 rating5031 requires quoted Failed-AVP; RFC6733 base5011 is unsupported version, distinct from TS32.299 experimental10415/5011. Normal CCA keeps mandatory268 plus optional297 and received628; unknown namespaces/features preserved with incomplete semantic report, top2001/experimental5011 reports conflict. All experimental/features transmission blocked pending audited pairing/negotiation. Selected E grammar rejects experimental pairing and requires5031 diagnostic. No rating, automatic retries, generated experimental pair or persistence.",
    "Batch50: runtime contract1.6/R33 scoped RO-06 first slice; audited CCR subset grants TransportReplay for fixed sameOCS activeexchange only. ExplicitRetransmit or TransportFailover require prebound DestinationHost/Realm, sole terminal source, declared ReplayDomain retention, finite attempts and originaldeadline. Immutable body/Session/CCType/Number/Action/E2E, perconnectionHBH and cumulativewrite-evidence T. Valid answers including errors/conflicts terminate without recovery. No responsewait/Tx/Tr, changedOCS, restartimport, DDFHpolicy, automatic businessretry or persistence. RFC4006 sections5.7/6.5 and RFC6733 section3; deployment deduplication evidence not established by local mechanism tests.",
    "Batch54: bounded receive-only normal CCA base4002 for the existing smsfw-ro-recovery-v1 error set. Owned answer and incomplete semantic report; standard 4002 meaning is not broadened and local generation remains prohibited. Named local ErrorAnswer continuation is opt-in, original OCS only, valid top-level base codes only, pre-Tx cutoff for the legacy extra set; no child/experimental error authorization, persistence or automatic business retry."
